{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><u><strong>IN HER IMAGE</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>A Studio MHB horror game</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up in her old family bedroom. You can\u2019t remember how you got there, but she's missing. She needs your help. Something about this whole situation is off, but you have no choice but to press on. If she\u2019d be anywhere she\u2019d be in the old barn. It was always her favorite spot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse an eerie setting as you look for your missing love. Piece together clues and puzzles as you turn nightmarish corridors. Keep on your feet however, as something is amiss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Puzzles</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think your way through creative and rewarding puzzles to progress through the old family farmstead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053030/extras/9d058d516253f6b825958efc220d3ba1.avif?t=1762412274\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053030/extras_big/9d058d516253f6b825958efc220d3ba1.webp?t=1762412274 width=1560 height=669 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hand painted world</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a beautifully haunting world filled exclusively with hand painted textures, (Not a single downloaded texture or model!)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053030/extras/3e3901db3cf00fb9bc6dc59861c4df22.avif?t=1762412274\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053030/extras_big/3e3901db3cf00fb9bc6dc59861c4df22.webp?t=1762412274 width=1560 height=669 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Terrifying scares</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid the appalling monstrosity that seems to be haunting you, as you traverse a property filled with secrets and spectral threats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053030/extras/bf40dae53be0ca2650fcb75a01ba1e19.avif?t=1762412274\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053030/extras_big/bf40dae53be0ca2650fcb75a01ba1e19.webp?t=1762412274 width=1560 height=669 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Compelling story telling</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seek out and piece together clues to figure out the mystery of what's happening through engaging narrative and environmentally based storytelling.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053030/extras/0b3874d9d0237e3d6ad255b9e8d2ad0d.avif?t=1762412274\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053030/extras_big/0b3874d9d0237e3d6ad255b9e8d2ad0d.webp?t=1762412274 width=1560 height=669 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple endings</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your actions matter here, face the results of the path you chose to decide Elias\u2019s fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053030/extras/0d4077dcd57427c97fc5bd4e3341e832.avif?t=1762412274\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053030/extras_big/0d4077dcd57427c97fc5bd4e3341e832.webp?t=1762412274 width=1560 height=669 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Thoughtful Combat</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scavenge for weapons, consumables and ammo, however combat may not be the preferable option against nightmarish foes.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053030/extras/1ebf8f131c987fd0454e9e8c4e5ccbb1.avif?t=1762412274\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053030/extras_big/1ebf8f131c987fd0454e9e8c4e5ccbb1.webp?t=1762412274 width=1560 height=669 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4053030?t=1762412274","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4053030?t=1762412274","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053030/d06fd5e5ca888408eda0a55ab95bfa4aecd4f358/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762412274","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053030/d06fd5e5ca888408eda0a55ab95bfa4aecd4f358/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762412274","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Depiction of suicide."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><u><strong>IN HER IMAGE</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>A Studio MHB horror game</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up in her old family bedroom. You can\u2019t remember how you got there, but she's missing. She needs your help. Something about this whole situation is off, but you have no choice but to press on. If she\u2019d be anywhere she\u2019d be in the old barn. It was always her favorite spot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse an eerie setting as you look for your missing love. Piece together clues and puzzles as you turn nightmarish corr